[FMV Audio Skip Fix]
author=Ghost
description=Fixes choppy/skippy dialogue and audio desync in cutscenes/FMVs. Do not enable together with 60FPS or Combined option.

patch=1,EE,003AD710,word,24030002

[60 FPS]
author=Asasega
description=Unlocks 60 FPS. May require EE Cycle Rate overclock for stable performance. Do not enable together with the FMV fix or Combined option.

patch=1,EE,203AD720,extended,2C420001

